I'm not telling the patience game players to stop playing Nethack 3.4.3.
I'm saying how I think it would be good for the game to change in
3.4.4/3.5/4.0/whatever.  Likewise, David isn't telling people to stop
playing Nethack 3.4.3, he's (rather forcefully, I admit) expressing an
opinion about what would be desirable properties of 3.4.4/3.5/4.0/whatever.

That's the great thing about Nethack: you can find a version you like
and stick with it, or you can follow the update curve.

